 "rationale": "At a 412px-wide viewport the scoring grid cannot stay a table: each player becomes a full-width card stacked vertically (Akira, then Mei, then Hiroshi), and inside a card every label/input pair reflows to one row per line with the numeric field pinned right. Landscape rows in setup keep the label left and the A/B/C radios in a narrow right-hand column so the row never wraps. Chrome is trimmed to a single top bar and one footer action pair, and the page grows very tall (4600px capture) rather than scrolling horizontally \u2014 vertical scroll is cheap on a phone, horizontal scroll inside a score sheet is not."}, {"id": "packages_module_tori_valley_src_ui_scoredetail_scoredetailreducer_scoredetailreducer", "label": "scoreDetailReducer (tori-valley)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "apps/scoreo/tests/visual/toriModule.visual.spec.ts-snapshots/tori-score-edit-phone-linux.png", "source_location": "packages/module-tori-valley/src/ui/scoredetail/scoreDetailReducer.ts:113", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "packages_module_tori_valley_src_ui_scoredetail_objectiflandscapeentry_objectiflandscapeentry", "label": "ObjectifLandscapeEntry (tori-valley)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "apps/scoreo/tests/visual/toriModule.visual.spec.ts-snapshots/tori-score-edit-phone-linux.png", "source_location": "packages/module-tori-valley/src/ui/scoredetail/ObjectifLandscapeEntry.tsx:21", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "apps_scoreo_tests_visual_torimodule_visual_spec_ts_snapshots_tori_score_edit_phone_linux_screenshot", "target": "apps_scoreo_tests_visual_torimodule_visual_spec_ts_snapshots_tori_score_edit_state", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "apps/scoreo/tests/visual/toriModule.visual.spec.ts-snapshots/tori-score-edit-phone-linux.png", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"sourc